 creators didn’t make it past their first encounter.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/extras/5229d31689cadbd545487d3d7cd0d570.poster.avif?t=1785374715\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/extras/5229d31689cadbd545487d3d7cd0d570.webm?t=1785374715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/extras/5229d31689cadbd545487d3d7cd0d570.mp4?t=1785374715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you’re getting into</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One life per engineer — death is permanent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A station too big to learn — you never wake in the same place twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Route knowledge is worthless — no two playthroughs run the same way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper is deadlier — worse company the further you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your way out — stealth keeps you alive longest, not forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hands on everything — diegetic, physical, no floating menus.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/extras/0613dd45da177e99ba25315898644df0.poster.avif?t=1785374715\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/extras/0613dd45da177e99ba25315898644df0.webm?t=1785374715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><s